    "detailed_description": "<strong>Ninja Maker</strong> is a 3D platformer game that you can create your own levels. Unleash your creativity and design the levels of your dreams!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign:</h2>Explore 5 worlds with 25 different levels. Find all the collectibles while fighting with various enemies. Be careful! At the end of every world, a boss fight waiting for you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create, Play and Share:</h2>Build levels however you want! Add blocks, enemies, coins, obstacles, traps and others. Share your levels and play other levels created by players around the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Block-Based Programming:</h2>Make your own gameplay by adding logic to blocks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gachapon</h2>Collect coins to buy gachapons and unlock new characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fun combat: fight various enemies with your katana and shuriken<br></li><li> Discover secrets with an 360\u00b0 interactive camera<br></li><li> 5 worlds and 25 different levels<br></li><li> Block-based programming<br></li><li> Level editor</li></ul><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546680/extras/8d887f3b59162b6b72e4f69f21b0bef5.avif?t=1705524200\" /></span>",
